<title>UK: Barnsley issues 90 million stg 20-year loan stock.</title>
<headline>Barnsley issues 90 million stg 20-year loan stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following partly-paid issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BARNSLEY METROPOLITAN BOROUGH COUNCIL</p>
<p> AMT     90 MLN STG   COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    17.FEB.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE *98.6666   PAY DATE   *17.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPREAD     +55.7 BP  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2015</p>
<p> NOTES     *32.0000 PAYABLE ON 17.FEB.97.</p>
<p>		33.3333 PAYABLE ON 17.FEB.98.</p>
<p>		33.3333 PAYABLE ON 17.AUG.98.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
